    <section>
      <h2>Is your small business ready?</h2>
      <p>UAE e-invoicing will change how small traders create, send and receive business invoices, but the change does not need to be complicated. Start by understanding your customer base. Then review your accounting software. If you are not VAT-registered, do not assume you are exempt, because your B2B and B2G sales may still fall within the rules. A small business that organises its records, checks its software and picks a suitable ASP early will have a much easier transition.</p>
    </section>

